      "name": "main-tabs"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscriptions}"
              ],
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "cap-section-driver",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "CapacitySection",
                  "type": 1,
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": []
                  },
                  "value": "overview"
                }
              ],
              "style": "pills",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
            },
            "name": "cap-shared-params"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "ℹ️ **Navigation:** Start with **📋 Overview**, compare fleet trends and forecasts in **🌍 Multi-instance**, then drill into machines, storage and workloads in **🔍 Single instance**. Use **🖥️ Hyper-V** for Azure Local machine capacity, VM inventory and performance."
            },
            "name": "cap-instructions-text"
          },
          {
            "type": 11,
            "content": {
              "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
              "style": "tabs",
              "tabStyle": "larger",
              "links": [
                {
                  "id": "tab-ov",
                  "cellValue": "CapacitySection",
                  "linkTarget": "parameter",
                  "linkLabel": "📋 Overview",
                  "subTarget": "overview",
                  "style": "link"
                },
                {
                  "id": "tab-multi",
                  "cellValue": "CapacitySection",
                  "linkTarget": "parameter",
                  "linkLabel": "🌍 Multi-instance",
                  "subTarget": "multi",
                  "style": "link"
                },
                {
                  "id": "tab-single",
                  "cellValue": "CapacitySection",
                  "linkTarget": "parameter",
                  "linkLabel": "🔍 Single instance",
                  "subTarget": "single",
                  "style": "link"
                },
                {
                  "id": "tab-hyperv",
                  "cellValue": "CapacitySection",
                  "linkTarget": "parameter",
                  "linkLabel": "🖥️ Hyper-V",
                  "subTarget": "hyperv",
                  "style": "link"
                }
              ]
            },
            "name": "cap-section-tabs"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscriptions}"
              ],
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "capacity-workspace-subscriptions",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "CapacityWorkspaceSubscriptions",
                  "type": 6,
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "'",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [
                      "value::all"
                    ],
                    "includeAll": true,
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "defaultValue": "value::all",
                  "value": [
                    "value::all"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "capacity-la-workspace",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "MachinesLogAnalyticsWorkspace",
                  "label": "Log Analytics Workspace",
                  "type": 2,
                  "description": "Select one or more Log Analytics workspaces for telemetry across all Capacity & Performance views. The Overview capacity table uses Azure Resource Graph and is unaffected. Managed Prometheus uses the separate Azure Monitor Workspace selector. Workspace discovery uses all accessible subscriptions independently of the top-level subscription, resource-group and instance-tag filters, including workspaces in a separate monitoring subscription. All queries every discovered workspace; select only the workspaces receiving the required telemetry to limit query scope and avoid access or resource-count errors.",
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "'",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "includeAll": true,
                  "defaultValue": "value::all",
                  "query": "resources\r\n| where type == \"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces\"\r\n| project value = id, label = name\r\n| order by label asc",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{CapacityWorkspaceSubscriptions}"
                  ],
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [
                      "value::all"
                    ],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "queryType": 1,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
                  "value": [
                    "value::all"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "dcr-setup-toggle",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "ShowDCRSetupSection",
                  "label": "Show DCR Setup Guide",
                  "type": 10,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "jsonData": "[{\"value\": \"yes\", \"label\": \"Yes - Show DCR Setup\"}, {\"value\": \"no\", \"label\": \"No - Hide DCR Setup\"}]",
                  "value": "no"
                }
              ],
              "style": "pills",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
            },
            "name": "capacity-workspace-params"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "**'Log Analytics Workspace'** filter scope: The filter above applies across all Capacity & Performance views. The first table in Capacity & Performance --> Overview tab uses Azure Resource Graph (ARG) only, so is unaffected by this filter, all other tabs in Capacity & Performance use this LAW filter.\r\n\r\nWorkspace discovery is independent of the top-level subscription, resource-group and instance-tag filters. Select the telemetry workspace even when it is in a separate monitoring subscription. **All** queries every discovered workspace; select specific workspaces to limit query scope and avoid access or resource-count errors. Inventory views retain their existing filters.\r\n\r\n**DCR setup:** Use **Show DCR Setup Guide** beside the filter for AMA prerequisites, required counters and events, and maintained deployment links. Managed Prometheus charts in Overview use the separate **Azure Monitor Workspace** selector and collection setup."
            },
            "name": "capacity-workspace-scope-note"
          },
          {
            "type": 12,
            "content": {
              "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
              "groupType": "editable",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": 1,
                  "content": {
                    "json": "## 🔔 Capacity Telemetry Readiness\r\nPerformance and forecast telemetry across Capacity requires Azure Monitor Agent (AMA), the selected Log Analytics workspace, and the LENS Capacity data sources. The first table in Capacity & Performance --> Overview uses Azure Resource Graph and is unaffected. Managed Prometheus uses the separate Azure Monitor Workspace selector and collection setup."
                  },
                  "name": "text-dcr-setup-header"
                },
                {
                  "type": 1,
                  "content": {
                    "json": "### Capacity telemetry checklist and steps\r\n\r\n1. Install **Azure Monitor Agent (AMA)** on every machine.\r\n2. Select this workbook's Log Analytics workspace. Create the DCR in the same Azure region.\r\n3. Deploy the dedicated **LENS Capacity DCR** with all 26 host and Hyper-V counter paths plus Event 3002. These include **14 Hyper-V counter paths**, sent to `Perf` every 60 seconds. Event 3002 supplies CSV volume capacity and forecasts.\r\n4. Associate the DCR with every physical machine, excluding Arc-enabled guest VMs. Use Azure Policy and run a remediation task for existing machines.\r\n5. Verify machine Heartbeat, Perf, four Cluster CSVFS paths and Hyper-V counters; verify instance Event 3002. Missing Hyper-V rows can indicate a counter-path, association, agent, or propagation issue. Zero samples do not prove workload coverage.\r\n\r\nA dedicated rule is recommended. **Do not associate another DCR collecting the same paths into this workspace.** Multiple DCR associations are additive; AMA does not deduplicate overlapping collection, causing duplicate rows and ingestion cost.\r\n\r\n### Knowledge links and instructions\r\n\r\n#### 1. [📘 LENS DCR Setup and Deployment Guide](https://github.com/Azure/AzureLocal-LENS-Workbook/blob/main/example-dcr-template/README.md)\r\n\r\n#### 2. [📄 LENS Capacity DCR Template](https://github.com/Azure/AzureLocal-LENS-Workbook/blob/main/example-dcr-template/dcr-azurelocal-capacity-perf.json)\r\n\r\n#### 3. [🔗 DCR Associations](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-monitor/data-collection/data-collection-rule-associations)\r\n\r\n#### 4. [🧭 Data Collection Rules](https://portal.azure.com/#view/Microsoft_Azure_Monitoring/DataCollectionRulesBlade)\r\n\r\n#### 5. [💾 Cluster Shared Volumes](https://learn.microsoft.com/windows-server/failover-clustering/failover-cluster-csvs)\r\n\r\n#### 6. [🖥️ Hyper-V Performance Tuning](https://learn.microsoft.com/windows-server/administration/performance-tuning/role/hyper-v-server/)",
                    "style": "info"
                  },
                  "name": "dcr-setup-readiness"
                }
              ]
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "ShowDCRSetupSection",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "yes"
            },
            "name": "dcr-setup-group"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "capacity-tab-group"
    }
  ],
  "fallbackResourceIds": [
    "azure monitor"
  ],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}
